{"candidate_identity":"02336d130f2a3b034ab539fba40a2e7e50c16d6e5b7a78d4da11ea5b0d77226e","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"32c1ffbae03da0f6c49f8e25b6ffee1f5d57462a409ef43cc6457e6c51bfc824","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"70349db4017ed12dcbf347e73fc8cd2ceee1f97f4329c0c5cee4dd09a7585477","logical_entry_identity":"8416169ac41300375fa24ff597edfb69e28c10d9f0b28ea463ab33f34810583c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You fire a special explosive shot with your steamgun(s) at a spot within range.\n\t\tWhen each shot reaches its target, it does normal steamgun damage and explodes within radius %d, which does %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用蒸汽枪在射程内制造一场特殊的爆炸。\n　　当每一个弹片击中它的目标，造成正常蒸汽枪伤害和半径 %d 码内的爆炸，造成 %0.2f 的物理伤害，\n　　这个技能不使用弹药。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d402dc9a10da8819810ffa47c8e4faf05416334a902381d2b8a92d9d158b772","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"70456b4cf414f6dfe1dc55fb847983bcdab4174635e75d86c5aae858e077af9e","logical_entry_identity":"431ce549471f41d939f403a3179b9bc4892903be591ec24e4112e81475b33037","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"tools","source_tag":"_t","target":"工具"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"698586893b1c387cf7d9455ca81853b6b62f66e162e6e8bcf535206c8d7309d4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7048f8eb48fa8be2d81f77ce2a670ed3dde182412f48862e0832a7ef5519ebde","logical_entry_identity":"26be0ef7f589d7333270db6510ffcdab5422bf3488291f2d81db305092bf5831","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"darkness pin","source_tag":"damage type","target":"黑暗定身"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f9cd795f7d0aabb54c26b51643cf8a442efe77f4faf62f90246fc9d821a48312","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"704f4dd7b2aa24d17d8d273eea715605e8b38b707f4d7352700700dcecd57b2c","logical_entry_identity":"d0a76f38587f418d7c06d95ac3e780946726164417c58451a3f0ee7ee0a81af5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"sunwall","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"太阳堡垒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9212f009befeda98e62e7b0cc1a6179e1fd9edb099da2cc5154912f6fb815216","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7056ffa12f057b74b57a3d278a272940bd3d69dbff46d0839087e75b65e44b43","logical_entry_identity":"319747a08be2369f7f0e730b2f8dce4918ae9758020ea4ee34b1136e1feabff7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sunwall Outpost","source_tag":"_t","target":"太阳堡垒前哨站"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b649c1eb82ab37f624f16e472940e61d7b8493152dc8e379f58ee261e4912307","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7068beaf994c2b57f4a56128fdee0a45b70cc45bc27b6225f2d71f9f138e87fb","logical_entry_identity":"fa1380ae2e56fd3bef6b1ff3319edba9d29f6aad031e3df36744b22841d80763","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"A glass pillar containing a still living brain.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一根玻璃柱，里面装着一个仍然活着的大脑。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"998babb911e952412381ec0b6c7c1093c4508bb75ab56ae6fa56a335338942e7","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7088bd64cb0369f43b10ee08740b67cea4920a083080bbc7d73f8736a24eece3","logical_entry_identity":"425cb048c807b7dab87c196b5bb180828b25047ae18ea61f88d8606237f861db","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You must have an empty space to leap to.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你必须有一块空地才能跳跃过去。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0f40efd9c201f186c6e6078c5dd78d5921f84cdda0714d542f3a249e1ddfc69","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"70a23528bd9d08897d3cb292385d2b5db72f45bf6f21b3d09dacc5e00c322690","logical_entry_identity":"94af1d17c269c1b0d2c3ebba545670af809c2c992b9898317461764b33c2e20c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The work continues, and soon all shall know the name of their new god.  Even handling the one Hand that I have makes me weep for the sins of my brothers, and yet eager to see their work undone...  The bowels of Eyal shall be the forge in which You will be remade, the newly-drained magma channels above shall be its fire.\n\nI can barely bring myself to tell You the indignity I suffer through in service to You...  Unfit savages, ones not of Your creation and thus undeserving of Your mercy, are in possession of one of the last two pieces of Your body.  I met with the \"Atmos,\" and offered them a tiny fraction of Your approval and power in return for it, far more than enough to make up for the geothermal vents emptied to fuel Your rebirth; they fear Your blessings, and rejected my offer.  They are a proud tribe, one that has been proud for so long that they never noticed that they no longer had anything to be proud of.  I have seen such pride before only once, and it is even more misplaced by the Atmos.  They will remain blind and defiant until the moment they fall, and I shall simply wait to sift through the fragments of their dead civilization.\n\nI am sorry, my god - were I in a better position, Your rebirth would not be contingent on #{italic}#negotiating#{normal}# with the unworthy souls trespassing in Your world...  but I cannot afford the risk of using force.  Perhaps it is some minor consolation that You will now be able to personally show them Your fury.","source_tag":"_t","target":"工作仍在继续，很快所有人都将知晓他们新神的名讳。即使只是处理我手中的这一只“手”，也足以让我为兄弟们的罪孽落泪，却又迫不及待想看他们的造物被摧毁……埃亚尔的深处将成为重铸你的熔炉，上方那些新近排空的岩浆通道则会化作炉火。\n\n我几乎羞于告诉你，为侍奉你，我忍受了何等屈辱……一群不配的野蛮人——并非你的造物，因而不配得到你的怜悯——竟掌握着你躯体最后两块碎片之一。我与“气之部族”会面，提出以你极少的一部分认可与力量换取它；这份回报远远足以补偿为你重生而耗尽的地热喷口。他们却畏惧你的赐福，拒绝了我的提议。他们是个骄傲的部族，骄傲了太久，久到没有察觉自己早已一无可傲。我只见过一次如此傲慢，而气之部族的傲慢甚至更加不合时宜。他们会一直盲目而顽抗，直到覆灭的那一刻；我只需等待，届时从他们文明的尸骸中筛出那块碎片。\n\n抱歉，我的神——若我的处境好些，你的重生本不至于取决于同这些擅闯你世界的不配灵魂#{italic}#谈判#{normal}#……但我承担不起动用武力的风险。或许略可聊慰的是，如今你将能亲自向他们展现你的怒火。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"735ee1bca532fb588e79a05b276a77aaf1a8aa6a75d547eb2b7dcaf4360a6515","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"70df1a57825f9b76f5baf5e5111360490468f35895291c16a2f37bd907b089d9","logical_entry_identity":"2b8bcec563881b432b3952973539fdbe3c